# Per-venue animation data for the painted stage plates + the build step that embeds plates and data in index.html.
# Coordinates are in the 640x240 plate (read off tests/stagegrid.py sheets). Effect kinds are drawn by stageFx() in index.html:
# tw twinkling lamps, fl flames, fgl flickering glows, glow/neon/pulse soft ellipses (pulse can follow the beat), chase/ring lamp chasers,
# rain/snow, smoke, drift (fireflies, dust), wave (water glints), sc (sparkle scatter), bub (bubbles), aurora (moving bands).
# usage: python3 tests/stagefx.py    (rewrites the block between /*STAGES:BEGIN*/ and /*STAGES:END*/)
